1. First you need to have extra A100 GPUs mainly being used  for evaluating the GPU kernels that are generated by your model and you have to optimize this module on your own. You may be able to run them on other GPUs too but I can't promise that it would work. In later versions, we plan to automate this part so you can just send the kernels to services on [basilica](https://www.basilica.ai/) to take care of this. But for now you have to optimize it on your own. 
