1475990896162897930,1233428828479819876,ט・ready・33,799672011265015819,188485281148698624,papiercirer,papiercirer,"# 🚀 SN33 Agentic Transcription System

Hello everyone!

We're launching our Agentic Transcription System - an autonomous pipeline that discovers, retrieves, and transcribes public conversations across the web at scale. This is a foundational addition to how SN33 sources and processes data.

## Rollout
Scheduled for February 26th, 2026 at 10:00 AM

## Why This Matters
The web isn't just text on a page. Millions of hours of public conversation - podcasts, interviews, panels, debates - carry expertise and nuance that no written article can replicate. Until now, that knowledge has been trapped in audio, invisible to AI and unsearchable by agents. With site enrichment, we organized the written web. Now we're organizing the spoken web.

## Key Highlights
- Agentic Discovery: The system doesn't wait for input. It autonomously finds the highest-signal conversations happening in public and feeds them directly into the subnet for enrichment.
- Virtually Limitless Scale: The pipeline scales horizontally without bottleneck, giving the subnet a continuous, ever-expanding stream of fresh conversation data to process.
- Category-Native from Day One: Every conversation enters the system tagged to a category, enabling category-specific task routing and opening the door to customer-requested categories.

## For Miners and Validators
No action required. This system enhances the data pipeline feeding the subnet. You'll benefit from higher volume and greater task diversity automatically.

## What's Next
This system becomes a cornerstone of the subnet - enabling broader coverage, richer data, and the foundation for everything we're building next. Not just what people write, but what they say

Happy validating and mining ⛏️
