### Next Steps

The next tournament will feature the same task but with a different benchmark dataset to verify whether our continuous validation updates function as expected.

Beyond the Leatherback tournament, we plan to organise at least two tournaments per task:

* The top miner’s code is revealed at the end of the first tournament, allowing further optimisation of policies in the second tournament
* Developing a high-quality new task requires extensive research and testing. Iterating on a task allows the owner team to return with more refined tasks that will accelerate our journey toward SOTA robotics

