Hello everyone!

Following the successful rollout of our Agentic Transcription System, we are immediately deploying it to target specific, high-value data verticals. The era of generic data collection is over. Today, we are turning our focus to Coding and Developer/AI Empowerment.

## The Shift: Same Scale, Sharper Focus
The Agentic Transcription System allows us to do more than just ""transcribe the web."" It allows us to curate it autonomously. We are now directing our agents to hunt, retrieve, and process high-signal technical conversations. We are unlocking a massive reservoir of human intelligence that traditional text scraping simply cannot reach.

### Why Coding & AI First?
Code is more than syntax; it's the logic behind the decision. GitHub gives AI the ""how,"" but developer podcasts, conference talks, and technical panels give AI the ""why."" By capturing this spoken knowledge, we are building a dataset that empowers AI to understand developer intent, not just code completion.

### What This Means for the Subnet
- Hyper-Targeted Tasks: The subnet will now generate tasks specifically tagged for coding and AI development contexts.
- Enhanced Granularity: This is the first step in a larger roadmap. We are actively working to bring this level of specific, category-native targeting to all existing task types on the subnet.
- Higher Value Data: We are moving from broad coverage to deep, vertical-specific expertise.

### For Miners and Validators
No action required. These changes are implemented upstream via the Agentic pipeline. You will simply begin seeing a higher concentration of technical and developer-centric data flowing through the system.

## The Future
We are building the smartest data pipeline in the ecosystem. Today it's code. Tomorrow, it's everything.

## Rollout
Effective immediately. Systems are live.

