## Our first non-football task/element is finally here.

From now on, all tasks/elements will follow the same launch process.

1. A new task/element is announced  
Miners are notified here that a new task is ready to launch.

2. Miner Starter Pack is released  
A Miner Starter Pack - a comprehensive guide explaining the task/element and how to approach it - is shared here so miners have time (a few days) to prepare.

3. Manifest generation  
A manifest is automatically generated, defines the evaluation framework and becomes the reference for task/element evaluation.

**4. Each task/element will be evaluated based on its own set of pillars.**
5. TEST phase begins  
Every new task/element automatically enters a Test Phase and receives **1% of emissions** while miners begin testing and submitting models.

6. Emissions scaling  
Once the Test Phase is complete, the task/element can receive **up to 10% of emissions** depending on its complexity and urgency.

7. Console access  
All tasks will also be accessible through the new version of the Console, which provides a unified interface for monitoring and interacting with them (see screenshots: https://x.com/MaxScore/status/2028421947986497977?s=20).

### Timeline

1. The Test Phase for this task/element will begin mid-March (this month).
2. The current football task/element will remain active until we launch the private track.

