### Features
* Added support for raw volumes.  Existing qcow2 volumes will continue to work, but any new volumes should be in raw format.  Update your config accordingly.
* Updated system manager API, specifically to improve cache performance and avoid resource constraints when multiple download were in progress.
* Updated qemu args to improve disk throughput and network performance
* Updated cache cleaner image to check check for processes on GPU and vram threshold, hopefully this coupled with the graceful shutdown for Chutes will help alleviate some of the CUDA issues.
### Bugfixes
* Fixed issue where resource constraints would cause 500 error while multiple downloads in progress in system manager API
