1480897887444537365,1342559689690583202,ᚱ・vidaio・85,799672011265015819,461070713080512513,bruhvatar,bruhvatar,"**FAO all miners and validators:**
https://github.com/vidAio-subnet/vidaio-subnet/pull/134 would be merged Thursday 9 AM UTC with the following considerations:
- currently, the registration cost for miners is too high (around 0.5 TAO per key) as the top coldkeys are incentivised to use the same underlying solution on as many hotkeys as possible while deduplicating synthetics to gain more emissions, this introduces frictions for new miners to test and iterate on their solutions.
- the changes in the PR are meant to incentivise the top coldkeys to iterate on their existing hotkeys to reach top 50, effectively they would gain no advantage for holding over 50 hotkeys per task, moreover, new hotkeys begin with an `accumulate_score` (final factor used for calculating miner's score) of 0 which further deincentivises over-registration (unless top coldkeys are doing it for love of the game to keep new miners out)

