Elsewhere, we are also considering moving upscaling synthetics to the same framework as compression synthetics where the same challenge is broadcast each cycle, open to feedback from miners and validators here.",2026-03-10T11:59:30.119000+00:00,2026-03-10T12:00:26.602000+00:00,False,,False,0,0,2
