1481839586517979287,1381987595881414656,ⴷ・ⴷffine・120,799672011265015819,1198913646894518297,beastmaster_1123,Sharon MHMD,"Hi  <@1091660419023773828>  <@389189199514959893> 
Quick idea to fix the hotkey spam and high reg fees everyone's complaining about.
Right now the ""only 1 commit per hotkey"" rule forces people to make new hotkeys every time they tweak or upload a new model. That jacks up registration costs for everybody (more regs = higher fee, like you said).
The copy detection is already super solid , tao_miner's script + block checks catch copycats no problem.

So how about this easy swap:
Drop the hard ""1 commit only"" limit
Add a cooldown instead (like 24h or 48h between commits on the same hotkey)

Boom:
No more spam floods
Miners can update models without burning new hotkeys
Fewer new regs -> reg fee drops naturally
new miners actually get a shot (lots of people are hurting bad from fees)

@SickDuck and @Paco and others already said pretty much the same thing .
@Const was happy when reg fees stayed low before , this would help bring them back down without breaking anti-copy stuff.
You guys open to trying this in the next update?",2026-03-13T02:21:28.674000+00:00,2026-03-13T02:21:56.375000+00:00,False,,False,0,0,0
