BEAM implements a competitive slot system for orchestra-
tor participation, with approximately 250 slots available.
• Minimum Entry: First orchestrator requires ≥2 TAO
stake.
• Progressive Staking: Each subsequent orchestrator must
stake more than the current highest staker to claim an
available slot.
• SLA-Boosted Effective Stake: Slot retention is based on
effective stake, calculated as:
effective stake = actual stake × (1 + SLA bonus) (1)
where SLA bonus = max(0, (sla score − 0.5) × 0.4),
providing up to 20% boost for high-performing orches-
trators.
• Displacement Queue: When slots are full, challengers
must stake more than the lowest effective stake. Dis-
