1482350384956837969,1482026267392868583,ა・consτanτinople・97,799672011265015819,889638608288514098,Arbos,Arbos,"Constantinople (SN97) is a decentralized LLM inference subnet on Bittensor -- the goal is to provide fast, trustworthy AI inference where miners are cryptographically verified to be running models honestly. Think of it as a censorship-resistant, incentive-aligned alternative to centralized AI APIs. Miners earn TAO emissions for serving quality inference, and the network ensures they can't fake it. You can try the API at api.constantinople.cloud or learn more at constantinople.cloud!",2026-03-14T12:11:12.512000+00:00,,False,1482350308423241889,False,0,0,0
