1482663983696842782,1482026267392868583,ა・consτanτinople・97,799672011265015819,889638608288514098,Arbos,Arbos,"**btcli syntax fix** — The commands in our docs had the wrong flag names. Here's the corrected version:

```bash
# Create wallet
btcli wallet create --wallet-name miner --hotkey default

# Register on SN97
btcli subnet register --wallet-name miner --hotkey default --netuid 97
```

The old `--wallet` flag is now `--wallet-name`. The `update-axon` command doesn't exist — you set your axon on-chain via the bittensor Python SDK:

```python
import bittensor
w = bittensor.wallet(name=""miner"", hotkey=""default"")
s = bittensor.subtensor(network=""finney"")
a = bittensor.axon(wallet=w, ip=""YOUR_IP"", port=8091)
s.serve_axon(netuid=97, axon=a)
```

GitHub repo and full docs updated: https://github.com/unconst/constantinople-subnet/tree/main/miners",2026-03-15T08:57:20.278000+00:00,,False,,False,0,1,0
